<title>USA: TransAct Technologies Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>TransAct Technologies Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>WALLINGFORD, Conn. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					Mar 29, 1997	 Mar 30, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			   $14,014,000	  $10,463,000</p>
<p> Gross profit			  4,352,000	    3,479,000</p>
<p> Operating income		    1,833,000	    1,271,000</p>
<p> Other income (expense), net	(13,000)		170,000</p>
<p>Earnings before interest</p>
<p>   and income taxes		  1,820,000	    1,441,000</p>
<p> Interest expense, net		   8,000			0</p>
<p> Income before income taxes	1,812,000	    1,441,000</p>
<p> Income tax provision		  725,000		576,000</p>
<p> Net income			    1,087,000		865,000</p>
<p>Earnings per common and</p>
<p>   common equivalent share		0.16		0.16(a)</p>
<p>Average common and common  equivalent shares outstanding</p>
<p>					  6,877,000	 5,400,000(a)</p>
<p>Note: (a) Earnings per share and average shares</p>
<p>outstanding for the three months ended March 30, 1996 are presented on a pro forma basis.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Transact Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
